  "prefLabel": "Env-Hw 1402.10 Used Oil Introduced into Crude Oil Pipelines or a Petroleum Refining Facility",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Hw 1402.10 Used Oil Introduced into Crude Oil Pipelines or a Petroleum Refining Facility.\n\n(a) Subject to the amendments specified in (b), below, the provisions in 40 CFR 279.10(g) are incorporated by reference and shall apply to used oil introduced into crude oil pipelines or a petroleum refining facility.\n\n(b) The following amendments shall apply to the incorporated requirements:\n\n(1) Amend 40 CFR 279.10(g)(1) through (g)(6) by replacing each occurrence of “this part” with “this chapter”; and\n\n(2) Amend 40 CFR 279.10(g)(4) by replacing “§ 279.11” with “Env-Hw 1404.02”.\n\nSource. #14282, eff 8-1-25, EXPIRES: 8-1-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-hw1400.html"
